        "# PART 1 — FILTER METHOD: SelectKBest + ANOVA F-test `(25 pts)`\n",
        "\n",
        "A filter method gives every feature a **score** based on how related it is to the label. It does this **before** training, without any learning algorithm, and keeps the features with the highest scores.\n",
        "\n",
        "You will use `SelectKBest` with the **ANOVA F-test** (`f_classif`)."
      ]
    },
