        "1. Create a `SelectKBest` selector that uses `f_classif` and keeps `k` features. Name it `selector_filter`. `(4 pts)`\n",
        "2. Fit it on `X_train` and `y_train`. `(4 pts)`\n",
        "\n",
        "*Hint: `SelectKBest(score_func=f_classif, k=k)`*"
